; The stress's header. postb's cards in; for a rules word (its end card, -21 or -22 for a function word, then ah)
; out the header postc reads: -30, fn (1 for a function word) and ah (0 for a function word). Anything else goes
; through as it is.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-21: a card: a header, or pass it on
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    ADD   c23
  06                    TAC   pass
  07                    SUB   n3
  08                    TAC   hdr
  09            pass    OUT   x
  10                    JMP   rec
  11            hdr     INP   ah
  12                    OUT   m30
  13                    ADD   00
  14                    TAC   fw
  15                    OUT   z
  16                    OUT   ah
  17                    JMP   rec
  18            fw      OUT   00
  19                    OUT   z
  20                    JMP   rec
  30            x       DATA  0
  31            ah      DATA  0
  32            z       DATA  0
  33            c23     DATA  23
  34            n3      DATA  3
  35            m30     DATA  -30
